flowchart LR
  Library[Selected library tracks] --> Analysis[Local analysis]
  Analysis --> Design[Deterministic v4 design snapshot]
  Design --> Arrangement[Constrained arrangement provider decision]
  Arrangement --> Compile[Deterministic FFmpeg compiler]
  Compile --> Candidate[Candidate MP3 and append-only manifest]
